~ start
You wake up...
As you scan the surrounding area, you spot someone.
=> loop

~ loop
#Me: [do! show_character_sprite(DialogueCharacterView.CharacterPosition.LEFT, "player")] Um...
#[do! hide_character_sprite(DialogueCharacterView.CharacterPosition.RIGHT)] He left.
Me: Um...
Test: [[Hai|Hello|Halo]], this is some dialogue.
Test: Please ask something.
- Who are you?
	Test: I'm a human.
- Where am I?
	Test: You are lost.
- Say it again? => loop
- Alright, just shut up! => END
Test: Ok, goodluck!
He left.
You're on your own.
=> END

~ talk
[do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm") show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")].
Elena: Yes dear?
- I love you
	Adrian: I love you.
	Elena: ( ＾ω＾ )
- Nothing => END
=> END

